<title>UK: IMI says to buy Sulzer valves unit.</title>
<headline>IMI says to buy Sulzer valves unit.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Engineering group IMI Plc said on Thursday that it would acquire the Thermtec industrial valves division of Swiss-based Sulzer AG for an initital cash consideration of 10 million stg.</p>
<p>A further amount of up to three million stg may become payable in cash depending on the profit performance in the period to December 31, 1997.</p>
</text>
